{"id":"68ee45ca9dee2182","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-mod-finite.md","title":"模有限等价与包含","display":"df-mod-finite — 模有限等价与包含","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-mod-finite","aliases":["20-df-mod-finite"],"display":"df-mod-finite — 模有限等价与包含","chapter":"2","section":"2.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"§2.1.7 的 E*；模有限记号展开","source_pdf_pages":[63],"source_printed_pages":[27],"depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-mod-finite"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-mod-finite</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-mod-finite — 模有限等价与包含"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§2.1.7 的 E*；模有限记号展开"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>63</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mod\\text{-}finite}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA=^*B\\Longleftrightarrow |A\\triangle B|&lt;\\omega,\\qquad\nA\\subseteq^*B\\Longleftrightarrow |A\\setminus B|&lt;\\omega,\\\\\n[A]^*:=\\{B\\subseteq\\omega:A=^*B\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Cofinite}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow |\\omega\\setminus A|&lt;\\omega.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mod\\text{-}finite}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA=^*B\\Longleftrightarrow |A\\triangle B|&lt;\\omega,\\qquad\nA\\subseteq^*B\\Longleftrightarrow |A\\setminus B|&lt;\\omega,\\\\\n[A]^*:=\\{B\\subseteq\\omega:A=^*B\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Cofinite}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow |\\omega\\setminus A|&lt;\\omega.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>模有限是集合层面的等价，不是 Turing 等价。有限对称差保持 c.e. 性，但所有同度集合通常不 c.e.。</p>\n<p>来源：§2.1.7 的 E*；模有限记号展开；印刷页 27；PDF 第 63 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mod\\text{-}finite}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA=^*B\\Longleftrightarrow |A\\triangle B|<\\omega,\\qquad\nA\\subseteq^*B\\Longleftrightarrow |A\\setminus B|<\\omega,\\\\\n[A]^*:=\\{B\\subseteq\\omega:A=^*B\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Cofinite}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow |\\omega\\setminus A|<\\omega.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1083,"backlinks":[{"id":"b726984ad897f45b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-column-extraction]]；see [[20-df-mod-finite]]。"},{"id":"2db5f72c1596f66e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-mod-finite]]；see [[20-thm-re-closure]]。"},{"id":"5d21586b2bafee69","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-mod-finite]]。"},{"id":"eb8af3ed33936908","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-mod-finite]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-df-sigma-complete]]；see [[20-thm-tot-complexit